<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan money and bond markets closed for holidays.</title>
<headline>Taiwan money and bond markets closed for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's money and bond markets are closed on Wednesday due to New Year holidays. They will reopen on Saturday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the overnight interbank rate ended at 5.465 percent against Monday's 5.219 close, with 30-day commercial paper at 5.75 against 5.00-5.10.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
